%N A222619 Number of live cells at the n-th generation of 'spacefiller 1', utilizing Conway's S23/B3 Game of Life rules.
%C A222619 Fills at the highest density, at the greatest rate, utilizing S23/B3 rules.
%H A222619 Qiyuan Gu, <a href="/A222619/b222619.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..9999</a>
%H A222619 LifeWiki, <a href="https://conwaylife.com/wiki/Spacefiller_1">Spacefiller 1</a>.
%H A222619 <a href="/index/Rec#order_07">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (1,1,-1,1,-1,-1,1).
%F A222619 a(n) = ((n+19)^2+463)/4 if n == 0 (mod 4), ((n+19)^2+487)/4 if n == 2 (mod 4), and ((n+18)^2+639)/4 if n is odd.
